// Connectathon STEADI demonstration. Clinical logic is authored here.
// The supplied fixture contract establishes community-dwelling ambulatory context,
// excludes hospice/long-term care, and supplies one screen per encounter.
// Patient age uses the supported age-today projection. Retrospective encounter-age
// evaluation and original QuestionnaireResponse status association are not claimed.
library "Steadi".

terminology "STEADI Question Codes":
- system is `http://loinc.org`.
- code is `100257-5` display is `Feel unsteady when standing or walking`.
- code is `97878-3` display is `Worried about falling`.
- code is `52552-7` display is `Falls in the past year`.
// Declaring terminology does not claim the emitted local-answer profiles carry
// these external question codes. See the concrete code-binding probe/readout.

concept "Age 65 Or Older":
- shape is Record.
- type is Observation.
- value type is boolean.
- shape reduction is most recent.
- source representation:
  - type is Patient.
  - value projection is age today at least 65 years.

concept "Unsteady":
- shape is Record.
- type is Observation.
- value type is boolean.
- code is `unsteady`.
- shape reduction is most recent.
presentation for "Unsteady":
- question text is "Do you feel unsteady when standing or walking?".

concept "Worries About Falling":
- shape is Record.
- type is Observation.
- value type is boolean.
- code is `worries-about-falling`.
- shape reduction is most recent.
presentation for "Worries About Falling":
- question text is "Do you worry about falling?".

concept "Fallen In Past Year":
- shape is Record.
- type is Observation.
- value type is boolean.
- code is `fallen-in-past-year`.
- shape reduction is most recent.
presentation for "Fallen In Past Year":
- question text is "Have you fallen in the past year?".

concept "Has Unsteady Answer":
- shape is Record.
- type is Observation.
- value type is boolean.
- definition is "Unsteady" has a value.
- shape reduction is most recent.
concept "Has Worries Answer":
- shape is Record.
- type is Observation.
- value type is boolean.
- definition is "Worries About Falling" has a value.
- shape reduction is most recent.
concept "Has Fall Answer":
- shape is Record.
- type is Observation.
- value type is boolean.
- definition is "Fallen In Past Year" has a value.
- shape reduction is most recent.

criterion "In Screening Population":
- when ("Age 65 Or Older").
criterion "All Three Answers Present":
- when ("Has Unsteady Answer" and "Has Worries Answer" and "Has Fall Answer").
criterion "Any Positive Screening Answer":
- when ("Unsteady" or "Worries About Falling" or "Fallen In Past Year").

activity "Exercise Guidance":
- request CPGCommunicationRequest.
- with `Exercise interventions are recommended for community-dwelling adults 65 years or older at increased risk of falls (USPSTF grade B). This is guidance, not an intervention order.`.
activity "Consider Multifactorial Intervention":
- request CPGCommunicationRequest.
- with `Individualize whether to offer a multifactorial intervention, considering prior falls, comorbidities and patient preferences (USPSTF grade C). This is guidance, not an intervention order.`.

decision "Screening Guidance":
- when "In Screening Population" then:
  - when "All Three Answers Present" then:
    - when "Any Positive Screening Answer" then:
      all:
      - recommend activity "Exercise Guidance".
      - recommend activity "Consider Multifactorial Intervention".
      end.
    end.
  end.
